{
  "name": "1. 重组物质",
  "icon": "minecraft:writable_book",
  "category": "dustandash:beginning",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "基础尘已经能转化成最初的实用材料，其中也包括铁。$(br2)这一阶段的核心装置是$(l:dust/integrated_block)聚合方块$(/l)，它会依照固定位置重新组合材料。$(br)若需要岩浆，可查阅$(l:dust/lava)制作岩浆$(/l)。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "dustandash:crafting/iron_nugget",
      "recipe2": "dustandash:crafting/integrated_block"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "四个$(item)一级聚合框架$()能够扩展聚合方块。$(br2)$(l:ash/ash_collector)余烬收集器$(/l)会从燃烧中的熔炉收集烬。烬可以进入烬钢粗料，再经熔炼成为烬钢锭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "dustandash:crafting/integrated_frame_1",
      "recipe2": "dustandash:crafting/ash_collector"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(l:dust/milling_machine)铣床和装配台$(/l)负责研磨与装配配方。$(br)它也会提供制作下一层聚合框架与更复杂材料所需的部件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "dustandash:crafting/milling_machine",
      "recipe2": "dustandash:crafting/integrated_frame_2"
    }
  ]
}